          <p class="lead">Four steps, done on WhatsApp and one short online form. No meetings, wherever you are in South Africa.</p>
        </div>
        <ol class="proc">
          <li><h3>Tell us about your business</h3><p>Your business name, what you do and where. Two minutes on WhatsApp.</p></li>
          <li><h3>See your homepage free</h3><p>A view-only preview link, designed and written for you. No payment yet.</p></li>
          <li><h3>Approve and pay to start</h3><p>One-Page is paid in full, Business and Catalogue pay half. Then you fill in one checklist form for your package.</p></li>
          <li><h3>2 rounds of changes, then live</h3><p>On your own .co.za, 3 to 7 working days after your content arrives, with a sheet showing what you own.</p></li>
        </ol>
        <div class="need">
