          <div class="need-grid">
            <div><p class="need-h">Every package</p><ul><li>Business name, logo if you have one</li><li>Services and prices</li><li>Areas you serve and your hours</li><li>Phone, WhatsApp and email</li><li>6 to 15 photos of your work</li></ul></div>
            <div><p class="need-h">Business and Launch Pack</p><ul><li>A few lines on each service</li><li>Your Google Business Profile, or we create one</li><li>Before and after photos, if you have them</li><li>Logo and poster ideas (Launch Pack)</li></ul></div>
            <div><p class="need-h">Catalogue</p><ul><li>Your product list on our template</li><li>One photo per product</li><li>Delivery or collection areas and fees</li><li>Your PayFast or Yoco account, if you want payments</li></ul></div>
